Package: allocatR
Type: Package
Title: Random Allocation Algorithms For Clinical Trials
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Hannah Johns
Maintainer: Hannah Johns <dr.hannah.johns@gmail.com>
Description: Provides algorithms for randomly allocating participants in clinical trials. Contains functions that supports real-time sequential random allocation as well as trial simulations to aid trial design and facilitate re-randomisation tests. 
